{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "overview",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🎓 EduCRM Architecture Overview\n\nCentralized Multi-Tenant Education Management Engine\n\n- Live Deployment: [https://education-crm-9fee2.web.app](https://education-crm-9fee2.web.app)\n- Stack: React 19 + TypeScript + Vite + Firebase Firestore",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -300,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "admissions_module",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 🛡️ Admissions Officer Module\n\n- **Route**: `/admissions/*` (`AdmissionsRoute.tsx`)\n- **Hook**: `useAdmissionsData.ts`\n- **Workspace**: `AdmissionsWorkspace.tsx` \n\n### Functions\n- Application Queue (20 Stages)\n- Document Verification Audit\n- Offer Letter & Decision Issuance\n- CAS & Visa Milestone Tracking",
      "x": -350,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "finance_module",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 💳 Finance Officer Module\n\n- **Route**: `/finance/*` (`FinanceRoute.tsx`)\n- **Hook**: `useFinanceData.ts`\n- **Workspace**: `FinanceWorkspace.tsx` \n\n### Functions\n- Invoicing (Tuition, Fees, Deposits)\n- Payment Receipts & Multi-currency\n- Student Refunds Approval\n- Agent Commission Statements",
      "x": 350,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "counsellor_module",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 🎓 Counsellor Module\n\n- **Route**: `/counsellor/*` (`CounsellorRoute.tsx`)\n- **Hook**: `useCounsellorData.ts` \n\n### Functions\n- Lead Pipeline Management\n- Student Profile & Academic History\n- Document Uploads\n- Entry Requirement Programme Matcher",
      "x": -350,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "teamleader_module",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 👥 Team Leader Module\n\n- **Route**: `/team-leader/*` (`TeamLeaderRoute.tsx`)\n- **Hook**: `useTeamLeaderData.ts` \n\n### Functions\n- Workload & Application Reassignment\n- Counsellor Directory & Activity\n- Conversion Performance Analytics",
      "x": 350,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "app_entity",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### 📄 Application Entity\n\n- 20 Stages (`Draft` → `Enrolled`)\n- History Timestamps & Audit Notes",
      "x": -40,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "student_entity",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### 👤 Student Entity\n\n- Passport & Nationality\n- Academic Records & GPA\n- English Scores (IELTS/TOEFL/PTE)",
      "x": -40,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "invoice_entity",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### 🧾 Invoice & Payment Entities\n\n- Fee Receipts & Balances\n- Refund & Commission Claims",
      "x": 350,
      "y": -220,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "3"
    }
